<title>UK: Lehman Bros closes down London bullion operations.</title>
<headline>Lehman Bros closes down London bullion operations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment house Lehman Brothers International said on Monday it had closed down its gold trading operations in London. &quot;We are withdrawing from market making in the London bullion market and there will be minimal redundancies,&quot; a company spokesman said. &quot;The numbers affected will be very small.&quot; Industry sources said two people in the precious metals department would be laid off.</p>
<p>U.S.-based Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc said on Friday it had closed its gold trading operations and laid off some natural gas traders.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 2936</p>
